{"text": "For a moment he wondered whether his son would soften and come back with the dogs to take him along. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he soon let the thought go, because he knew that this was the law of all living things. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nature did not care about a single life, and the only task that she gave to every creature was to have young ones. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When that task was done, death came, and this was the rule that every creature had to obey in the end. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The mosquito vanished with the first frost, and the little tree squirrel crept away to die alone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old rabbit grew too slow to run from its enemies, and even the great bear became blind and clumsy at last. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In his strong years he had led his people as their chief, and he too had once made a hard choice like his sons. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Long ago, one winter before the missionary came, he had left his own father behind on an upper reach of the Klondike. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was not cruelty that made him do it, but the same law that now left him alone by the fire.", "alignment": {"characters": ["F", "o", "r", " ", "a", " ", "m", "o", "m", "e", "n", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "n", "d", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "w", "h", "e", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "o", "n", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", "e", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "o", "m", "e", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "g", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "a", "k", "e", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "a", "l", "o", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "o", "o", "n", " ", "l", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "g", "o", ",", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "h", "